{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55142","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 三十二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 三十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何煞重，天狗是其殃。\n无杀福神相次恶，天雷并者是（京本作「也」）无妨，三杀可商量（京本作「参商」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}